<Slide style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, padding: 0, background: '#FFFFFF', position: 'relative' }}>
        <Image src="assets/banner.jpg" style={{ position: 'absolute', top: 0, left: 0, width: 1280, height: 60, objectFit: 'cover' }} />
    <Text style={{ position: 'absolute', top: 15, left: 60, width: 735, fontSize: 28, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF', letterSpacing: 1 }}>图卷积的两个旋钮：步数与邻居数</Text>
    <Text style={{ position: 'absolute', top: 23, left: 800, width: 200, fontSize: 15, color: '#BBD9F2', textAlign: 'right' }}>03 · <span style={{ color: '#FFF2CC', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>阶段 3</span> · 消融验证</Text>
    <Image src="assets/logo_bar.png" style={{ position: 'absolute', top: 8, left: 1010, width: 210, height: 44, objectFit: 'contain' }} />

    <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', top: 74, left: 60, width: 1160, height: 614, flexDirection: 'column' }}>

        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', marginTop: 6 }}>
            <Box style={{ width: 324, flexDirection: 'column', alignItems: 'center' }}>
                <Image src="assets/p_fig13.png" style={{ width: 320, height: 476 }} />
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 12, color: '#8B97A8', marginTop: 6, width: 300, textAlign: 'center' }}>图 13　迭代步数与邻居数 K 的影响</Text>
            </Box>

            <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column', marginLeft: 44 }}>

                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row' }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E5A9E', width: 30 }}>①</Text>
                    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', width: 720 }}>
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230' }}>迭代 3 步就够了</Text>
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#5A6675', lineHeight: 1.55, marginTop: 5 }}>
                            再往下传，消息会扩散过头，把本来不相似的远处节点也混进来，误差反而回升。
                        </Text>
                    </Box>
                </Box>

                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', marginTop: 30 }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E5A9E', width: 30 }}>②</Text>
                    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', width: 720 }}>
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230' }}>邻居数 K = 16 最好</Text>
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#5A6675', lineHeight: 1.55, marginTop: 5 }}>
                            K 太小，跨区域的相似块连不上；K 太大，不相似的块被硬拉进来，等于把噪声当证据。
                        </Text>
                    </Box>
                </Box>

                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', marginTop: 30 }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E5A9E', width: 30 }}>③</Text>
                    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', width: 720 }}>
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230' }}>两个旋钮都有明显最优点</Text>
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#5A6675', lineHeight: 1.55, marginTop: 5 }}>
                            说明 GCN 不是"堆得越多越好"的模块，论文据此定 3 步 / K=16，兼顾精度与开销。
                        </Text>
                    </Box>
                </Box>

                <Box style={{ background: '#E8F0FA', borderLeft: '4px solid #123C6E', padding: '13px 18px', marginTop: 24 }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.55 }}>
                        步数只增加消息传递轮次，不增加参数——这也是 MFFGCN 参数量只有 18.23 M 的原因。
                    </Text>
                </Box>
            </Box>
        </Box>
    </Box>
</Slide>
